# IFD-37 map/convert: convert a registered source map (GLIM dump, 原図) into a Nav2 2D map (RQ-I009).
# Started automatically by gouda_mode_manager at map end (TR-04) and manually from gouda_monitor (re-conversion).
# The result carries the artefact ids and content hashes; a failed conversion keeps the source and discards output.
string origin_id            # source map (由来 ID) in the map database
string settings_json        # conversion settings as a JSON object; empty = the node's declared parameters
---
bool ok
string message
string origin_id
int32 revision              # converted/<revision>
string content_hash         # of the converted artefact
string source_content_hash
string map_yaml_path
---
string stage                # reading, converting, writing, publishing
float32 progress            # 0..1
